  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"68725f95-8583-41f2-9aa4-d93cfdc977b0\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>It displays the visit information of a patient along with start date, end date and the type of the visit. <span>The active/current visit is marked with an asterisk (*).</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e7209c1d-903a-4e70-9594-791137ee101d\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Note</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><ul><li>Clicking on a particular visit will navigate to <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Configure Visit Dashboard\" ri:version-at-save=\"15\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Visit Dashboard ]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>displaying the information for that visit.</li><li><span>On clicking the title &quot;Visits&quot; in the below sample screenshot, a pop up showing all the visits of a patient will appear.</span></li><li><span>An example use case is<span> viewing the latest 8 visits of a patient.</span></span></li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><h2 class=\"auto-cursor-target\">Screenshot</h2><p><ac:image ac:title=\"Visit Control\" ac:alt=\"Visit Control\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Visit Control on Patient Dashboard.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><h2>Configuration</h2><h3>Sample Config</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"639a1739-9a26-48c1-b5b5-89505f5ccbeb\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Add to clinical/dashboard.json for it to appear on the patient dashboard</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"visits\": {\n            \"translationKey\": \"DASHBOARD_TITLE_VISITS_KEY\",\n            \"type\": \"visits\",\n            \"displayOrder\": 17,\n            \"dashboardConfig\": {\n                 \"maximumNoOfVisits\": 8\n                }\n         }]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3><span>Key Field Table</span></h3><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Key</th><th>Info</th><th colspan=\"1\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td><p>type</p></td><td><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>Indicates the type of the display control.</p><p><strong>type should be &quot;visits&quot;.</strong></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td></tr><tr><td><p>maximumNoOfVisits</p></td><td><p>Specifies the maximum number of visits for which to display data</p><ul><li>If it is empty, then by default all the visits for the patient are displayed.</li></ul></td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td></tr><tr><td><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24,54,145);\">dashboardConfig</span></p></td><td><p><span style=\"color: rgb(77,77,77);\">Indicates</span><span style=\"color: rgb(77,77,77);\"> that all the configurations mentioned under this are for the patient dashboard</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\"><p>displayOrder</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>The order in which the display control will be displayed</p></td><td colspan=\"1\">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\"><p>translationKey</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>Internationalizes the display control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\">Y</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">White</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Display Controls</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"300f309a-b2b6-43e3-99c8-d9eccea4c73b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"page\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Patient Controls\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:link></ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
