    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=ex7kr2kauo]{color:#183691} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=ex7kr2kauo]{color:#6e8ce7}[data-colorid=ed2vparxa3]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=ed2vparxa3]{color:#b2b2b2}[data-colorid=t1hqheeyck]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=t1hqheeyck]{color:#b2b2b2}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"VisitControl-Purpose\">Purpose</h2><p>It displays the visit information of a patient along with start date, end date and the type of the visit. <span class=\"conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"68725f95-8583-41f2-9aa4-d93cfdc977b0\" data-macro-name=\"excerpt\">The active/current visit is marked with an asterisk (*).</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7209c1d-903a-4e70-9594-791137ee101d\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Note</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>Clicking on a particular visit will navigate to <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945359/Configure+Visit+Dashboard\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945359\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Visit Dashboard </a>displaying the information for that visit.</li><li><span>On clicking the title &quot;Visits&quot; in the below sample screenshot, a pop up showing all the visits of a patient will appear.</span></li><li><span>An example use case is<span> viewing the latest 8 visits of a patient.</span></span></li></ul></div></div><p><br /></p><h2 class=\"auto-cursor-target\" id=\"VisitControl-Screenshot\">Screenshot</h2><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" alt=\"Visit Control\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/100139014/Visit%20Control%20on%20Patient%20Dashboard.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1479366013883&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/100139014/Visit%20Control%20on%20Patient%20Dashboard.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1479366013883&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"100139013\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Visit Control on Patient Dashboard.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"100139014\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"14\" data-media-id=\"1f453054-c889-49bb-8a51-a7204733b8be\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Visit Control\" /></span></p><h2 id=\"VisitControl-Configuration\">Configuration</h2><h3 id=\"VisitControl-SampleConfig\">Sample Config</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"639a1739-9a26-48c1-b5b5-89505f5ccbeb\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to clinical/dashboard.json for it to appear on the patient dashboard</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;visits&quot;: {\n            &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_VISITS_KEY&quot;,\n            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;visits&quot;,\n            &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 17,\n            &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n                 &quot;maximumNoOfVisits&quot;: 8\n                }\n         }</pre>\n</div></div><h3 id=\"VisitControl-KeyFieldTable\"><span>Key Field Table</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Info</th><th colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTh\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>type</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>Indicates the type of the display control.</p><p><strong>type should be &quot;visits&quot;.</strong></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>maximumNoOfVisits</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Specifies the maximum number of visits for which to display data</p><ul><li>If it is empty, then by default all the visits for the patient are displayed.</li></ul></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><span data-colorid=\"ex7kr2kauo\">dashboardConfig</span></p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><span data-colorid=\"ed2vparxa3\">Indicates</span><span data-colorid=\"t1hqheeyck\"> that all the configurations mentioned under this are for the patient dashboard</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>displayOrder</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>The order in which the display control will be displayed</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>translationKey</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Internationalizes the display control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Display Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"300f309a-b2b6-43e3-99c8-d9eccea4c73b\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227194/Patient+Context+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227194\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Context Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114227474/Patient+Profile+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114227474\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Profile Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/100139014/Visit+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"100139014\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Visit Control</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
